    rcap:evidenceText "The occurrence of the following should be screened for and reported as Serious Adverse Events (SAEs) for all participants in this domain, irrespective of intervention allocation: • Barotrauma (i.e., pneumothorax, subcutaneous emphysema, etc.) Other SAEs should be reported only where, in the opinion of the site investigator, the event might reasonably have occurred as a consequence of a study intervention or study participation (see relevant Core Protocol documents)." ;
